Package: python3-flagscale
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-typer, python3-hydra-core
Description: FlagScale large model training toolkit
 FlagScale is a comprehensive toolkit designed to support the entire
 lifecycle of large models, including training, serving, inference,
 and reinforcement learning. Developed by the Beijing Academy of
 Artificial Intelligence (BAAI).
 .
 This package provides the core library and the flagscale CLI.
 Heavy dependencies (PyTorch, Megatron, vLLM, etc.) are not included
 and should be installed via pip extras when needed:
   pip install "flagscale[cuda-train]"
